BT /F1 10 Tf 56 664 Td (During the March 12, 2026 outage documented in INC-301, the notifications service experienced a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 650 Td (significant backlog of merchant webhooks. As payment processing was disrupted, webhook events) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 636 Td (accumulated in the queue faster than the notification workers could process them. The backlog) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 622 Td (reached 26,900 webhooks before being cleared.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 600 Td (Impact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 580 Td (Merchants were unable to receive real-time webhook notifications about payment events during) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 566 Td (and after the outage. This delayed their ability to reconcile transactions, update order) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 552 Td (statuses, and trigger downstream business processes. The backlog persisted until notification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 538 Td (workers were scaled up to handle the accumulated load.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 516 Td (Timeline) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 496 Td (- 08:00 UTC: Outage begins; payment processing disrupted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 476 Td (- 14:30 UTC: Notifications team identifies webhook queue backlog) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 456 Td (- 15:15 UTC: Change CHG-1045 approved for emergency scale-up of notification workers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 436 Td (- 16:30 UTC: Backlog cleared; all 26,900 webhooks processed) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 414 Td (Root Cause) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 394 Td (The notifications service was sized for normal payment throughput. When the outage in INC-301) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 380 Td (disrupted payment processing, the rate of webhook events initially remained high while worker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 366 Td (capacity was insufficient to process them. The queue grew unchecked until manual intervention) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 352 Td (scaled the workers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 330 Td (Resolution) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 310 Td (Hannah Kim and the Merchant Experience team executed CHG-1045, scaling notification workers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 296 Td (from 8 to 24 instances. This increased processing capacity allowed the backlog to be cleared by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 282 Td (16:30 UTC. All queued webhooks were successfully delivered to merchants.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56 260 Td (Follow-up Actions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 240 Td (- Review RB-07 for webhook backlog procedures and update if needed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 220 Td (- Implement auto-scaling rules for notification workers to prevent future backlogs during) Tj ET
